ne-height:1.45;color:var(--muted)}
.privacy-boundary strong{color:var(--text)}
.proposal{border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--warn) 70%,var(--line));background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--warn) 7%,var(--surface));border-radius:10px;padding:8px;margin-top:8px;font-size:9px}
.proposal-actions{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:6px}.proposal-actions button{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--raised);border-radius:8px;padding:5px 7px;font-size:9px}
.org-lens{display:none}.org-lens.show{display:flex}
.org-context-only{display:none}.org-context-only.show{display:block}
.scope-note{font:650 9px var(--mono);color:var(--faint);margin-top:7px}

</style></head><body><div class="review">
<header class="review-head"><div><h1>E2.7 — scoped layers + VexOrg sandbox</h1><p>E2.6 is the approved reference baseline. This candidate keeps that entire body, adds explicit scroll/interaction scope, four-corner Vex resizing, and a synthetic VexOrg organization sandbox without turning employer visibility into private-companion surveillance.</p></div><div class="truth">BUILT ON APPROVED E2.6 REFERENCE BASELINE · MOCK DATA · NOT IMPLEMENTED</div></header>
<div class="baseline-strip"><strong>E2.6 baseline preserved:</strong>
<span class="sig">center = current context</span><span class="sig">physical relationships</span>
<span class="sig">projection lab</span><span class="sig">semantic zoom meter</span>
<span class="sig">intent-aware thresholds</span><span class="sig">centered recent-5 journey</span>
<span class="sig">animated sibling shift</span><span class="sig">projection workspace</span>
<span class="sig">summon Vex</span><span class="sig">direct gesture release</span>
<span class="sig new">scope owns interaction</span><span class="sig new">4-corner Vex resize</span>
<span class="sig new">VexOrg synthetic sandbox</span><span class="sig new">private Vex ≠ org visibility</span></div>
<div class="controls">
<div class="group"><span class="label">PROJECTION LAB</span><button class="ctrl active" data-geometry="fan">Fan</button><button class="ctrl" data-geometry="rings">Rings</button><button class="ctrl" data-geometry="carousel">Carousel</button></div>
<div class="group"><span class="label">THEME</span><button class="ctrl active" data-theme-choice="dark">Dark</button><button class="ctrl" data-theme-choice="light">Light</button></div>
<div class="group"><span class="label">DEVICE</span><button class="ctrl active" data-device="desktop">Desktop</button><button class="ctrl" data-device="mobile">Mobile</button></div>
<div class="group"><span class="label">JOURNEY</span><button class="ctrl" id="back">← Back</button><button class="ctrl" id="forward">Forward →</button></div>
<div class="group org-lens" id="orgLensGroup"><span class="label">VEXORG LENS</span><button class="ctrl active" data-org-lens="structure">Structure</button><button class="ctrl" data-org-lens="projects">Projects</button><button class="ctrl" data-org-lens="contributions">Contributions</button></div>
</div>
<div class="device-wrap"><div class="frame desktop" id="frame"><div class="app" id="app">
<div class="appbar"><button class="mark" id="summon" title="Bring Vex forward"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M 51.89 109.32 A 50 50 0 1 1 68.11 109.32 L 39.73 35.68 L 60 65.41 L 80.27 35.68 Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/></svg></button><div class="brand"><strong>VexLife Terrain</strong><small>VEX IS HOME · CENTER = CURRENT CONTEXT</small></div><div class="actions"><button id="historyBtn">Full journey</button><button id="up">Up one layer</button><button id="reset">Reset</button></div></div>
<div class="breadcrumb" id="breadcrumb"></div>
<div class="terrain" id="terrain">
      <div class="hud" id="hud"></div><div class="scope-chip" id="scopeChip">interaction scope · <strong>Terrain</strong></div>
      <div class="zoom-rail" aria-label="Terrain zoom controls">
        <button class="zoom-btn" id="zoomIn" aria-label="Zoom in">+</button>
        <div class="zoom-track" id="zoomTrack" aria-label="Zoom depth">
          <div class="zoom-mark enter"></div><span class="zoom-mark-label enter">enter</span>
          <div class="zoom-mark parent"></div><span class="zoom-mark-label parent">parent</span>
          <div class="zoom-knob" id="zoomKnob"></div>
        </div>
        <button class="zoom-btn" id="zoomOut" aria-label="Zoom out">−</button>
        <div class="zoom-percent" id="zoomPercent">100%</div>
        <div class="zoom-auto"><label><input type="checkbox" id="autoSemantic" checked> Auto-enter layers</label><small>Turn off for visual-only zoom.</small></div>
      </div>
      <div class="intent-tracker" id="intentTracker"><strong id="intentTitle">Exploring</strong><small id="intentDetail">Zoom trajectory is not committed yet.</small><div class="intent-bar"><div class="intent-fill" id="intentFill"></div></div></div>
      <div class="workspace-badge" id="workspaceBadge">projection workspace</div>
      <div class="world" id="world"><svg class="edge-svg" id="edges" viewBox="0 0 1200 800"></svg><div class="focus" id="focus"></div><div id="nodes"></div></div>
      <div class="adjacent" id="adjacent"></div>
    </div>
<div class="recentbar"><span class="recent-title">JOURNEY WINDOW</span><button class="recent-edge" id="recentPrev" aria-label="Earlier journey items">‹</button><div class="recent" id="recent"></div><button class="recent-edge" id="recentNext" aria-label="Later journey items">›</button><span class="journey-meta" id="journeyMeta"></span></div>
<div class="drawer" id="drawer"><div class="drawer-head"><h3>Full journey</h3><button id="closeDrawer">×</button></div><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:11px">Full semantic history stays here even when only the latest five actions are shown below the Terrain canvas.</p><div id="historyList"></div></div>
